#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "File"
msgstr "檔案"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide overlay"
msgstr "隱藏覆蓋層"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "結束"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vsync"
msgstr "垂直同步"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "全螢幕"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "FPS counter"
msgstr "FPS 計數器"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "On-screen notifications"
msgstr "螢幕通知"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Light-gun mode"
msgstr "光線槍模式"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Video"
msgstr "視訊"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wait for vertical blank before presenting.\n"
"Prevents tearing but adds up to one frame of latency."
msgstr ""
"顯示前先等待垂直空白。\n"
"可防止畫面撕裂，但會增加最多一格畫面的延遲。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "通知"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic (system)"
msgstr "自動（系統）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Language"
msgstr "語言"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "GPU"
msgstr "GPU"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto (best)"
msgstr "自動（最佳）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "算繪器"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Software"
msgstr "軟體"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which renderer draws the game. Applies on the\n"
"next launch - save settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"用來繪製遊戲的算繪器。下次啟動時生效，\n"
"請儲存設定並重新啟動。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window size"
msgstr "視窗大小"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr "寬度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr "高度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "1x (native)"
msgstr "1x（原生）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "8x (4K)"
msgstr "8x（4K）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D render scale"
msgstr "3D 算繪倍率"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Internal 3D rendering resolution. Higher is crisper 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD stays sharp). GPU backends only; the software\n"
"renderer stays native. Applies on the next launch - save\n"
"settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"內部 3D 算繪解析度。越高 3D 越清晰\n"
"（2D/HUD 保持清晰）。僅限 GPU 後端；\n"
"軟體算繪器維持原生解析度。下次啟動時生效，\n"
"請儲存設定並重新啟動。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "雙線性"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "整數倍"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "最近鄰"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharp-bilinear"
msgstr "銳利雙線性"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D scaling"
msgstr "2D 縮放"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How the frame is magnified to the window.\n"
"Sharp-bilinear keeps 2D text crisp without the shimmer\n"
"nearest shows at non-integer window sizes. Integer snaps\n"
"to a whole multiple (pixel-perfect, with black bars).\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"將畫面放大到視窗的方式。\n"
"銳利雙線性可在非整數倍視窗尺寸下保持 2D 文字清晰，\n"
"且沒有最近鄰產生的閃爍。整數倍會對齊到整倍數\n"
"（像素精確，帶黑邊）。\n"
"即時生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "4:3 (arcade)"
msgstr "4:3（大型電玩）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Square pixels"
msgstr "正方形像素"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "延展"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "長寬比"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
"Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
"Stretch fills the whole window. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"4:3 是大型電玩螢幕的比例（預設）。\n"
"正方形像素顯示原始的 496x384（略窄）。\n"
"延展會填滿整個視窗。即時生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "CRT filter"
msgstr "CRT 濾鏡"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cosmetic arcade-monitor look over the finished frame:\n"
"scanlines, an RGB shadow mask, glow and optional screen\n"
"curvature. Purely visual; applies live."
msgstr ""
"在完成的畫面上疊加大型電玩螢幕的外觀：\n"
"掃描線、RGB 蔭罩、光暈以及可選的螢幕\n"
"彎曲。純視覺效果，即時生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "掃描線"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "蔭罩"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "光暈"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "彎曲度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancement (cosmetic, beyond the original hardware)"
msgstr "強化（視覺效果，超越原始硬體）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropic"
msgstr "非等向性"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Faithful"
msgstr "忠於原味"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D texture filter"
msgstr "3D 材質過濾"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(unsupported)"
msgstr "（不支援）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This GPU does not report anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "此 GPU 未回報支援非等向性過濾。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropy"
msgstr "非等向性"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D upscale"
msgstr "2D 放大"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edge-smooth the 2D layers (HUD, text, menus). xBR and\n"
"ScaleFX round diagonals; Faithful keeps crisp pixels.\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"平滑 2D 圖層（HUD、文字、選單）的邊緣。xBR 與\n"
"ScaleFX 會讓斜線圓滑；忠於原味則保持像素清晰。\n"
"即時生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blended"
msgstr "混合"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stipple"
msgstr "點陣"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translucency"
msgstr "半透明"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hardware draws see-through surfaces (lights, glass,\n"
"shadows) as a checkerboard. Blended draws the 50%\n"
"see-through surface it's trying to achieve. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"硬體將半透明表面（燈光、玻璃、陰影）\n"
"繪製為棋盤格。混合模式則繪製其想呈現的\n"
"50% 半透明表面。即時生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "自訂材質"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace the game's 3D textures with images saved in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, named as dumped. GPU\n"
"renderers only; Reload picks up edited files."
msgstr ""
"以儲存在 saves/textures/<game>/load 中、\n"
"依傾印名稱命名的圖片取代遊戲的 3D 材質。\n"
"僅限 GPU 算繪器；「重新載入」可讀取編輯後的檔案。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%zu loaded"
msgstr "已載入 %zu 個"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "重新載入"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dump textures"
msgstr "傾印材質"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Collect every 3D texture the game draws and write them,\n"
"with an index.html to browse, to saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"when the game exits or this is turned off."
msgstr ""
"收集遊戲繪製的所有 3D 材質，連同可供瀏覽的\n"
"index.html 寫入 saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"（於遊戲結束或關閉此選項時）。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "音訊"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "路徑"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "瀏覽..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Config directory"
msgstr "設定目錄"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where sm2-emu.ini is read from and saved to.\n"
"Set with --config <dir>; cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""
"讀取與儲存 sm2-emu.ini 的位置。\n"
"透過 --config <dir> 設定；無法在此變更。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROM directory"
msgstr "ROM 目錄"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the ROM archives live. A game launched by name is\n"
"loaded from here as <name>.zip or <name>.7z."
msgstr ""
"ROM 壓縮檔所在位置。依名稱啟動的遊戲\n"
"會從這裡以 <name>.zip 或 <name>.7z 載入。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves directory"
msgstr "存檔目錄"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Battery-backed saves: per-game NVRAM (.nv) and EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) images -- high scores and operator settings."
msgstr ""
"電池備份存檔：各遊戲的 NVRAM（.nv）與 EEPROM\n"
"（.eeprom）映像檔——最高分與營運設定。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshots directory"
msgstr "螢幕截圖目錄"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where F12 screenshots are written."
msgstr "F12 螢幕截圖的儲存位置。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrape artwork online"
msgstr "線上取得封面圖"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let the game picker fetch box art and descriptions from\n"
"ArcadeDB over the network. Off keeps sm2-emu offline: the\n"
"picker still lists and launches every game, with placeholder\n"
"tiles and no descriptions."
msgstr ""
"讓遊戲選單透過網路從 ArcadeDB 取得\n"
"封面圖與簡介。關閉後 sm2-emu 保持離線：\n"
"選單仍會列出並啟動所有遊戲，\n"
"但使用預留圖塊且沒有簡介。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "遊戲手把"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel"
msgstr "方向盤"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Light Gun"
msgstr "光線槍"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network"
msgstr "網路"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "States"
msgstr "即時存檔"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "About"
msgstr "關於"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Sega Model 2 arcade emulator"
msgstr "SEGA Model 2 大型電玩模擬器"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "BSD 3-Clause licence. See LICENSE."
msgstr "BSD 3-Clause 授權條款。請參閱 LICENSE。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "sm2-emu exists because of open source shared with the community."
msgstr "sm2-emu 的存在，要歸功於與社群分享的開放原始碼。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "With thanks to the projects whose code makes it possible:"
msgstr "感謝以下專案，它們的程式碼讓這一切成為可能："

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "The MAME project - Sega Model 2 emulation guidance"
msgstr "MAME 專案 - SEGA Model 2 模擬參考"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Musashi - Motorola 68000 CPU core (Karl Stenerud)"
msgstr "Musashi - Motorola 68000 CPU 核心（Karl Stenerud）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ymfm - Yamaha FM sound cores (Aaron Giles)"
msgstr "ymfm - Yamaha FM 音源核心（Aaron Giles）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "SDL - windowing, input and audio"
msgstr "SDL - 視窗、輸入與音訊"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dear ImGui - this user interface (Omar Cornut)"
msgstr "Dear ImGui - 本使用者介面（Omar Cornut）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "pugixml - games.xml parsing"
msgstr "pugixml - games.xml 剖析"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "miniz - ZIP archive decompression"
msgstr "miniz - ZIP 壓縮檔解壓縮"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "LZMA SDK - 7-Zip archive decompression (Igor Pavlov)"
msgstr "LZMA SDK - 7-Zip 壓縮檔解壓縮（Igor Pavlov）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "VulkanMemoryAllocator - GPU memory (AMD / GPUOpen)"
msgstr "VulkanMemoryAllocator - GPU 記憶體（AMD / GPUOpen）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "shaderc / glslang - shader compilation"
msgstr "shaderc / glslang - 著色器編譯"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "stb_image - box-art image decoding (Sean Barrett)"
msgstr "stb_image - 封面圖片解碼（Sean Barrett）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gamepad picture - Xelu's Free Controller Prompts (Nicolae Berbece), CC0"
msgstr "手把圖片 - Xelu's Free Controller Prompts（Nicolae Berbece），CC0"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "libcurl - artwork scraping (optional)"
msgstr "libcurl - 封面圖擷取（選用）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "HarfBuzz - text shaping for translations"
msgstr "HarfBuzz - 翻譯文字塑形"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "SheenBidi - right-to-left text layout (Muhammad Tayyab Akram)"
msgstr "SheenBidi - 由右至左文字排版（Muhammad Tayyab Akram）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game artwork and descriptions from ArcadeDB"
msgstr "遊戲封面圖與簡介來自 ArcadeDB"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(adb.arcadeitalia.net, by Motoschifo)."
msgstr "（adb.arcadeitalia.net，作者 Motoschifo）。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "See NOTICE for full per-component attribution."
msgstr "完整的各元件姓名標示請參閱 NOTICE。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "If you'd like to support development:"
msgstr "如果您願意支持開發："

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "儲存設定"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Saved to %s"
msgstr "已儲存至 %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel connected."
msgstr "方向盤已連接。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "No wheel connected. Settings still apply once one is."
msgstr "未連接方向盤。連接後設定仍會生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force feedback"
msgstr "力回饋"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
"forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
"plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
msgstr ""
"賽車遊戲中的方向盤力道：從遊戲本身的驅動板\n"
"指令解碼出的回正力與過彎力，\n"
"以及撞擊時的衝擊震動。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resistance"
msgstr "阻力"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invert force feedback"
msgstr "反轉力回饋"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a wheel whose driver pushes the wrong way: it pulls\n"
"away from the centre instead of bringing it back, and\n"
"the game's forces go the opposite way."
msgstr ""
"適用於驅動程式方向推反的方向盤：它不回正\n"
"反而被拉離中心，遊戲的力也\n"
"朝相反方向作用。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble"
msgstr "震動"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts, for wheels without force\n"
"feedback. It never runs alongside force feedback."
msgstr ""
"在遊戲中發生撞擊時震動，適用於沒有力回饋的\n"
"方向盤。不會與力回饋同時運作。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble strength"
msgstr "震動強度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Engine vibration"
msgstr "引擎震動"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows with the throttle. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"隨油門增強的附加震動。它並非\n"
"來自遊戲。關閉後只感受遊戲本身的力回饋。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%u deg"
msgstr "%u 度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering range"
msgstr "轉向範圍"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set this to your wheel's own rotation range. The lock\n"
"angle below is mapped onto it, so matching your wheel\n"
"gives arcade-like response."
msgstr ""
"設定為您方向盤本身的旋轉範圍。下方的鎖定\n"
"角度會對應到此範圍，與方向盤相符\n"
"即可獲得接近大型電玩的手感。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lock angle"
msgstr "鎖定角度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
